CSS:
```css
body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  background-color: #0b0f19;
}

.button-stack,
.button-stack * {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
    "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
}

.button-stack {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 2.5em;
  padding: 2.5em;
  align-items: center;
}

.btn-wrapper {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  z-index: 1;
  opacity: 0;
  animation: floatIn 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
}

.btn-wrapper:nth-child(1) {
  animation-delay: 0.1s;
}
.btn-wrapper:nth-child(2) {
  animation-delay: 0.25s;
}
.btn-wrapper:nth-child(3) {
  animation-delay: 0.4s;
}

@keyframes floatIn {
  0% {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px) scale(0.9);
  }
  100% {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
  }
}

.btn-wrapper:hover {
  z-index: 10;
}

.orb-btn {
  position: relative;
  width: 5em;
  height: 5em;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  cursor: pointer;
  border: none;
  outline: none;
  background: radial-gradient(
    circle at 50% 50%,
    rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 0%,
    rgba(var(--glow-color), 0.08) 50%,
    rgba(var(--glow-color), 0.35) 100%
  );
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 0 25px 2px rgba(var(--glow-color), 0.35),
    inset 0 0 8px 1px rgba(var(--glow-color), 0.6),
    0 0 35px 2px rgba(var(--glow-color), 0.25);
  transition:
    transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1),
    box-shadow 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.orb-btn::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: linear-gradient(
    145deg,
    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25) 0%,
    transparent 40%,
    rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) 100%
  );
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 0;
  box-shadow: inset 1px 2px 4px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
}

.orb-btn::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: -150%;
  width: 50%;
  height: 100%;
  background: linear-gradient(
    to right,
    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 0%,
    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3) 50%,
    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 100%
  );
  transform: skewX(-25deg);
  z-index: 1;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.btn-wrapper:hover .orb-btn::after {
  animation: shimmerSweep 0.8s ease-out forwards;
}

@keyframes shimmerSweep {
  0% {
    left: -150%;
  }
  100% {
    left: 200%;
  }
}

.btn-wrapper:hover .orb-btn {
  transform: scale(1.06);
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 0 30px 4px rgba(var(--glow-color), 0.45),
    inset 0 0 12px 2px rgba(var(--glow-color), 0.7),
    0 0 50px 8px rgba(var(--glow-color), 0.35);
}

.btn-wrapper:active .orb-btn {
  transform: scale(0.92);
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 0 35px 5px rgba(var(--glow-color), 0.8),
    inset 0 0 15px 4px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7),
    0 0 30px 5px rgba(var(--glow-color), 0.4);
}

.orb-btn svg {
  width: 2.125em;
  height: 2.125em;
  stroke: #ffffff;
  stroke-width: 1;
  fill: none;
  stroke-linecap: round;
  stroke-linejoin: round;
  z-index: 2;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 3px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3));
  transition: all 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}

.btn-wrapper:hover .btn-teal svg {
  transform: scale(1.15) rotate(180deg);
}

@keyframes arrowFly {
  0% {
    transform: translate(0, 0);
    opacity: 1;
  }
  40% {
    transform: translate(20px, -20px);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  41% {
    transform: translate(-20px, 20px);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  100% {
    transform: translate(3px, -3px);
    opacity: 1;
  }
}

.btn-wrapper:hover .btn-silver svg {
  animation: arrowFly 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
}

.btn-mauve svg path {
  stroke-dasharray: 40;
  stroke-dashoffset: 0;
  transition: stroke-dashoffset 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}

@keyframes drawCheck {
  0% {
    stroke-dashoffset: 40;
  }
  100% {
    stroke-dashoffset: 0;
  }
}

.btn-wrapper:hover .btn-mauve svg {
  transform: scale(1.25);
}

.btn-wrapper:hover .btn-mauve svg path {
  animation: drawCheck 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
}

.btn-label {
  position: absolute;
  left: 100%;
  margin-left: -0.3125em;
  opacity: 0;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  white-space: nowrap;
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: all 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  transform: translateX(-10px) scale(0.95);
  filter: blur(8px);
  text-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
}

.btn-wrapper:hover .btn-label {
  margin-left: 2.5em;
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translateX(0) scale(1);
  filter: blur(0px);
  letter-spacing: 5px;
}

.btn-teal {
  --glow-color: 52, 142, 150;
}

.btn-silver {
  --glow-color: 180, 195, 210;
}

.btn-mauve {
  --glow-color: 188, 108, 148;
}

```

2)** Prompt gợi ý cho các nút icon đăng nhặp đăng kí hoặc các nút cần thiết **: Act as an expert frontend developer. Integrate this component into my project. Make it fully responsive.

HTML:
```html
<button class="steampunk-btn" aria-label="Button 1">
  <span class="btn-frame">
    <span class="btn-glass">
      <span class="glass-pattern"></span>
      <span class="amber-glow"></span>
      <span class="glass-reflection"></span>
      <span class="btn-text">✦</span>
    </span>
  </span>
</button>

```
CSS:
```css
body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  background-color: #141312;
}

.steampunk-btn {
  --bronze-dark: #2b2927;
  --bronze-mid: #63431f;
  --bronze-light: #856233;
  --bronze-highlight: #fce3a1;
  --glass-green-deep: #281d08;
  --glass-green-bright: #544212;
  --amber-light: #ffc95e;
  --amber-glow: #fa9a6a;

  position: relative;
  width: 110px;
  height: 110px;
  padding: 0;
  border: none;
  background: transparent;
  cursor: pointer;
  outline: none;
  border-radius: 22px;

  box-shadow:
    0 15px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),
    0 5px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
    inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);

  transition:
    transform 0.15s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
    box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}

/* Bronze frame */
.steampunk-btn .btn-frame {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: 22px;
  padding: 6px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background: linear-gradient(
    135deg,
    var(--bronze-highlight) 0%,
    var(--bronze-light) 20%,
    var(--bronze-mid) 45%,
    var(--bronze-dark) 70%,
    var(--bronze-light) 100%
  );
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 2px 3px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6),
    inset 0 -3px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),
    inset 2px 2px 4px var(--bronze-highlight),
    inset -2px -2px 4px #000;
  transition: box-shadow 0.1s ease;
}

/* Glass lens */
.steampunk-btn .btn-glass {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: 14px;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: radial-gradient(
    circle at 50% 50%,
    var(--glass-green-bright) 0%,
    var(--glass-green-deep) 85%
  );
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9),
    inset 0 0 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7),
    0 0 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  transition:
    background 0.1s ease,
    box-shadow 0.1s ease;
}

/* Mesh pattern */
.steampunk-btn .glass-pattern {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  opacity: 0.25;
  background-image: radial-gradient(
      var(--bronze-light) 0.5px,
      transparent 0.5px
    ),
    linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 49%, rgb(0, 0, 0) 50%, transparent 51%);
  background-size:
    8px 8px,
    6px 6px;
  mix-blend-mode: overlay;
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* Amber light */
.steampunk-btn .amber-glow {
  position: absolute;
  width: 70px;
  height: 70px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(
    circle,
    var(--amber-light) 0%,
    var(--amber-glow) 40%,
    transparent 75%
  );
  opacity: 0.6;
  filter: blur(6px);
  mix-blend-mode: color-dodge;
  transition:
    opacity 0.3s ease,
    transform 0.3s ease,
    filter 0.3s ease;
}

/* Glass reflection */
.steampunk-btn .glass-reflection {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  border-radius: 14px;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.steampunk-btn .glass-reflection::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 3px;
  left: 6px;
  right: 6px;
  height: 40%;
  background: linear-gradient(
    180deg,
    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) 0%,
    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 80%,
    transparent 100%
  );
  border-radius: 10px 10px 80% 80% / 8px 8px 15px 15px;
}

/* Text */
.steampunk-btn .btn-text {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  font-family: "Georgia", "Times New Roman", serif;
  font-size: 3.1rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--bronze-highlight);
  background: linear-gradient(
    180deg,
    #ffffff 0%,
    var(--bronze-highlight) 50%,
    var(--bronze-mid) 100%
  );
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  text-shadow:
    0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9),
    0 0 10px var(--amber-light);
  filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8));
  user-select: none;
  transition:
    text-shadow 0.3s ease,
    filter 0.3s ease;
}

/* Hover */
.steampunk-btn:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow:
    0 20px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85),
    0 0 15px rgba(255, 170, 0, 0.3);
}

.steampunk-btn:hover .amber-glow {
  opacity: 0.95;
  transform: scale(1.15);
  filter: blur(4px);
  animation: pulse-amber 1s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.steampunk-btn:hover .btn-text {
  text-shadow:
    0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9),
    0 0 16px var(--amber-light);
}

/* Active */
.steampunk-btn:active {
  transform: translateY(1px);
  box-shadow:
    0 5px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9),
    inset 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),
    0 0 35px rgba(252, 153, 15, 0.473),
    0 0 85px rgba(252, 153, 15, 0.29),
    0 0 165px rgba(255, 198, 85, 0.564);
}

.steampunk-btn:active .amber-glow {
  animation: none;
  opacity: 0.9;
  transform: scale(1.3);
  filter: blur(15px);
  background: radial-gradient(
    circle,
    #ffffff 0%,
    var(--amber-light) 30%,
    var(--amber-glow) 60%,
    transparent 80%
  );
}

.steampunk-btn:active .btn-glass {
  background: radial-gradient(
    circle at 50% 50%,
    var(--glass-green-bright) 0%,
    #4a3b10 60%,
    var(--glass-green-deep) 100%
  );
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 1),
    inset 0 0 20px rgba(250, 154, 106, 0.2),
    0 0 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
}

@keyframes pulse-amber {
  0%,
  100% {
    opacity: 0.5;
    transform: scale(1);
    filter: blur(6px);
  }
  50% {
    opacity: 0.9;
    transform: scale(1.12);
    filter: blur(4px);
  }
}

```

